```rust
fn to_refs<T>(mut list: Box<&mut List<T>>) -> Vec<&mut T>
```

Example:
```rust
fn main() {
    let mut list = Box::new(&mut List {
        value: 1,
        next: Some(Box::new(&mut List {
            value: 2,
            next: Some(Box::new(&mut List {
                value: 3,
                next: None,
            })),
        })),
    });

