You are tasked with creating a simple web application that displays a list of products. The application should retrieve product data from a JSON file and render it on a web page using HTML and JavaScript. Your task is to write the JavaScript code that fetches the product data from the JSON file and dynamically generates the HTML to display the products on the web page.

