You are tasked with creating a program that checks for the usage of a specific package in a set of Go files, excluding a known special case. Your program should search for occurrences of the package "ioutil" in the Go files within a given directory, but it should exclude a file named "stdlib.go" from the search. If any usages of "ioutil" are found in the Go files (excluding "stdlib.go"), the program should output an error message along with the specific occurrences. If no usages of "ioutil" are found, the program should output a success message.

