You are tasked with implementing a simple entity-component system (ECS) in Rust. An ECS is a design pattern used in game development and simulation systems to organize the data and behavior of entities within a game or simulation. In this problem, you will create a basic ECS framework using Rust's `core::ecs` module and implement a simple system for managing entities and their components.

