You are tasked with implementing a file download feature for a web application. The code snippet provided is a part of the server-side script responsible for pushing large files to the user. The script includes the necessary file inclusions and defines the file path for the uploaded files. Your task is to complete the script by adding the function that handles the file download and ensures efficient and secure file transmission to the user.

