Example:
Input file (input.txt):
```
6 7 10
```
Output file (output.txt):
```
3 10 5 16 8 4 2 1
Lie absolutely
22 11 34 17 52 26 13 40 20 10 5 16 8 4 2 1
Lie absolutely
5 16 8 4 2 1
Lie absolutely
```

### Solution:
